        "description": "No evidence of systemic vascular malformations or syndromic associations",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of at least two major criteria including fundoscopic lesion and fluorescein angiography findings",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily clinical supported by imaging; genetic testing is not routinely diagnostic."
